        definition: "Commissioned armed forces officers provide leadership and management to organizational units in the armed forces and\/or perform similar tasks to those performed in a variety of civilian occupations outside the armed forces. This group includes all members of the armed forces holding the rank of second lieutenant (or equivalent) or higher.",
