        tasks_include: 'Tasks performed usually include: controlling the operation of mechanical, electrical and electronic equipment on board ship or on aircraft; commanding and navigating ships or aircraft, directing the movements of ships or aircraft; developing electrical, electromechanical and computerized air control systems.',
