        tasks_include: 'Tasks performed usually include: recording goods produced, stocked, ordered and dispatched; recording production materials received, put into stock or issued; computing quantities of the production materials required at specified dates and helping with preparation and checking of production operation schedules; keeping records of operational aspects and coordinating the timing of passenger and freight transport.',
