        unit_group: '2656',
        title: 'Announcers on Radio, Television and Other Media',
        definition: 'Announcers on radio, television and other media read news bulletins, conduct interviews, and make other announcements or introductions on radio, television, and in theatres and other establishments or media',
        tasks_include: "Tasks include -\n(a)  reading news bulletins and making other announcements on radio or television;\n(b)  introducing performing artists or persons being interviewed, and making related announcements on radio and television, or in theatres, night-clubs and other establishments;\n(c)  interviewing persons in public, especially on radio and television;\n(d)  studying background information in order to prepare for programmes or interviews;\n(e)  commenting on music and other matters, such as weather or traffic conditions.",
        excluded_occupations: "Some related occupations classified elsewhere:\nJournalist- 2642",
