        title: 'Companions and Valets',
        definition: 'Companions and valets provide companionship and attend to various needs of the client or employer.',
        tasks_include: "Tasks include -\n(a)  providing companionship to employer by accompanying him\/her to various places, reading, conversing and participating in activities such as sports;\n(b)  assisting in entertaining visitors in employer's home;\n(c)  keeping wardrobe and personal effects of the employer in good order.",
