        code: '7111',
        major_group: '7',
        sub_major_group: '71',
        minor_group: '711',
        unit_group: '7111',
        title: 'House Builders',
        definition: 'House builders erect, maintain and repair houses and similar small buildings using either traditional or modern techniques and materials.',
        tasks_include: "Tasks include -\n(a)  preparing ground for erecting building or other structures;\n(b)  erecting structures to support roof, and building and covering walls with appropriate materials;\n(c)  fixing rafters to roof and covering with roofing material;\n(d)  levelling floor to make it smooth and serviceable;\n(e)  maintaining and repairing existing structures;\n(f)  arranging for specialized work such as bricklaying, painting, plumbing and electrical wiring to be done by subcontractors;\n(g)  coordinating and supervising the activities of subcontractors, labourers and other workers.",
