        unit_group: '7549',
        title: 'Craft and Related Workers not Elsewhere Classified',
        definition: 'This group covers craft and trade occupations not classified elsewhere in Major Group 7: Craft and Related Trades Workers. For instance, the group includes those who mould, slice, grind and polish optical lenses and those who arrange flowers for display.',
        tasks_include: "In such cases tasks would include -\n(a) heating, moulding and pressing optical glass to make lens blanks;\n(b) grinding and polishing lens blanks.",
