        title: 'Rubber Products Machine Operators',
        definition: 'Rubber-products machine operators monitor and operate machines which knead and blend rubber and rubber compounds and produce various components and products from natural and synthetic rubber, such as moulded footwear, domestic articles, insulating materials, industrial accessories, or tyres.',
        tasks_include: "Tasks include -\n(a)  operating and monitoring machines which knead, mix and blend rubber and rubber compounds for further processing;\n(b)  operating and monitoring machines which produce sheets of rubber or rubberized fabric by a rolling process;\n(c)  operating and monitoring machines which extrude compounded rubber or shape vulcanized rubber by moulding;\n(d)  operating and monitoring machines which build up tires on a form, vulcanise tires and mould or rebuild used tyres;\n(e)  examining outputs for defects and conformity to specifications;\n(f)  locating defects and repairing worn and faulty tyres by vulcanizing or other processes.",
        excluded_occupations: null,
        notes: null,
        occupational_titles: ['Maker, tyre', 'Moulder, rubber', 'Operator, calender: rubber', 'Operator, machine: coating (rubber)', 'Operator, machine: compounding (rubber)', 'Operator, machine: embossing (rubber)', 'Operator, machine: extruding (rubber)', 'Operator, machine: milling (rubber)', 'Operator, machine: moulding (rubber)', 'Operator, machine: moulding (tyres)', 'Operator, machine: rebuilding (tyres)', 'Operator, machine: rubber processing', 'Operator, machine: rubber products', 'Operator, machine: rubber stamp production', 'Operator, machine: tyre production', 'Operator, machine: vulcanising (rubber goods)', 'Operator, machine: vulcanising (tyres)', 'Operator, rubber processing plant', 'Repairer, tyre', 'Vulcanizer'],
